SO101 train  instructions:

data collection:

cd ~/shahil_ws/lerobot-datacollection
./scripts/collect_large_dataset.sh

you can edit the config file "so101_large_dataset.env" in config folder to deine a new task prompt.

push to hf:

hf auth login
hf upload shahils/so101-large-v1     /home/i2r/shahil_ws/lerobot-datacollection/datasets     datasets     --type dataset

pull from hf:

hf download shahils/so101-large-v1 \
    --repo-type dataset \
    --local-dir /scratch/$USER/so101-large-v1

build meta file:

python tools/build_so101_lerobot_meta.py     --dataset_roots /scratch/$USER/so101-large-v1/datasets/so101_large_v1_*     --output /scratch/$USER/so101-large-v1/metas/so101_large_v1_meta.json

run train:

accelerate launch     --num_processes 2     --mixed_precision bf16     train.py     --models "2toINF/X-VLA-Pt"     --train_metas_path /scratch/$USER/so101-large-v1/metas/so101_large_v1_meta.json     --output_dir /scratch/$USER/DiWINE-VLA/runnings/so101_large_v1_smoke     --action_mode auto     --real_action_dim 6     --max_action_dim 20     --batch_size 32     --num_views 3     --num_workers 4     --iters 2000     --save_interval 500     --learning_rate 1e-5     --train_vlm_pre   --vlm_pre_train_start_step 0
